%% VayuLoom autopilot agent lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Sensing : poll /api/aqi
    Sensing --> Evaluating : aqi sample ready
    Evaluating --> Planning : band change detected
    Evaluating --> Idle : no change
    Planning --> Approving : autopilotPlan built
    Approving --> Dispatching : GRAP policy allows
    Approving --> Idle : below threshold
    Dispatching --> Notifying : actions stored in DynamoDB
    Notifying --> Idle : SNS receipts logged
    Dispatching --> Escalated : Stage IV Severe Plus
    Escalated --> Idle : DOE compliance filed
